        <mxCell id="v7-filing-51" VariableRefs="1,2,3,10" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=18;fontColor=#20334A;strokeColor=#698499;fillColor=#F2F4F6;strokeWidth=1.5;spacing=8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.35;&quot;&gt;废弃输入（仅迁移对照，不占现用变量编号）excludedPool → &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FFE066;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;【1】存在结案时间&lt;/span&gt;＋&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FFE066;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;【2】存在退案时间&lt;/span&gt;rpaFilingStatus、rpaPassStage、rpaRejectStage→ &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FFE066;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;【3】存在立案提交记录&lt;/span&gt;至&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FFE066;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;【10】最近重新提交时间&lt;/span&gt;；原合成结果不能直接当新事实。&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
